{%- liquid
  assign main_product = section.settings.main_product
-%}

<section class="cth-story" id="video">
  <div class="page-width">
    <div class="cth-head"><span class="cth-eyebrow">Why they choose it</span><h2>The bed they pick over the couch.</h2></div>
    <div class="cth-story__row">
      <div><span>01 - Comfort</span><h3>A nook that calms the zoomies</h3><p>The raised, plush walls speak to a pet's natural instinct to burrow and feel protected. Anxious cats and dogs can lean in, settle down, and claim the spot they pick over your couch.</p></div>
      <div class="cth-imgslot ct-media ct-media--natural">
        {%- if section.settings.story_image_1 != blank -%}
          {{ section.settings.story_image_1 | image_url: width: 800 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', class: 'cth-imgslot__img', alt: section.settings.story_image_1.alt | escape }}
        {%- elsif main_product.featured_image != blank -%}
          {{ main_product.featured_image | image_url: width: 800 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', class: 'cth-imgslot__img', alt: main_product.title | escape }}
        {%- else -%}
          <span class="cth-ph">{% render 'ct-fa-icon', icon: 'paw' %}</span>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="cth-story__row cth-story__row--rev">
      <div><span>02 - Care</span><h3>Cleans up in one wash</h3><p>Fur, mud, and everyday pet mess are easier to manage because the whole bed can go in the machine on a cold gentle cycle. Air-dry or tumble low and it comes back soft.</p></div>
      <div class="cth-imgslot ct-media ct-media--natural">
        {%- if section.settings.story_image_2 != blank -%}
          {{ section.settings.story_image_2 | image_url: width: 800 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', class: 'cth-imgslot__img', alt: section.settings.story_image_2.alt | escape }}
        {%- elsif main_product.featured_image != blank -%}
          {{ main_product.featured_image | image_url: width: 800 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', class: 'cth-imgslot__img', alt: main_product.title | escape }}
        {%- else -%}
          <span class="cth-ph">{% render 'ct-fa-icon', icon: 'paw' %}</span>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="cth-story__row">
      <div><span>03 - Home</span><h3>The pet bed that doesn't look like one</h3><p>Coffee, Grey, and Black are warm neutral tones chosen to sit happily in your living room, not fight it. A pet sofa you do not have to hide when guests come over.</p></div>
      <div class="cth-imgslot ct-media ct-media--natural">
        {%- if section.settings.story_image_3 != blank -%}
          {{ section.settings.story_image_3 | image_url: width: 800 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', class: 'cth-imgslot__img', alt: section.settings.story_image_3.alt | escape }}
        {%- elsif main_product.featured_image != blank -%}
          {{ main_product.featured_image | image_url: width: 800 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', class: 'cth-imgslot__img', alt: main_product.title | escape }}
        {%- else -%}
          <span class="cth-ph">{% render 'ct-fa-icon', icon: 'paw' %}</span>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "CT home story",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section",
  "disabled_on": { "groups": ["header", "footer"] },
  "settings": [
    { "type": "product", "id": "main_product", "label": "Fallback product" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "story_image_1", "label": "Story image 1" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "story_image_2", "label": "Story image 2" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "story_image_3", "label": "Story image 3" }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "CT home story" }]
}
{% endschema %}
